C: box "C" fit


OP: box "Operand &larr;" fit at 2cm right of C.e
X: box "X" fit at 2cm right of OP

text "ROXL" bold at 1cm north of OP

arrow from OP.w to C.e
dot at 0.5cm west of OP.w
arrow from last dot up 0.75cm then right until even with X then down to X.n
arrow from X.w to OP.e





OP2: box "Operand &rarr;" fit at 2cm south of OP
text "ROXR" bold at 1cm north of OP2
X2: box "X" fit at 2cm west of OP2


C2: box "C" fit at 2.25cm right of OP2
arrow from OP2.e to C2.w
dot at 0.5cm east of OP2.e
arrow from last dot up 0.75cm then left until even with X2 then down to X2.n
arrow from X2.e to OP2.w